# Solar PV Calculator - Complete Feature Implementation Plan

## Goal Description

Transform the basic solar PV calculator into a professional-grade analysis tool comparable to PVGIS and PVSyst by implementing all missing features systematically across multiple phases. This includes real meteorological data integration, financial analysis, hourly simulations, shading analysis, battery storage modeling, and advanced visualizations.

## Implementation Strategy

**Phased Approach**: Build features incrementally, testing each phase before moving forward.

**Priority Order**: 
1. Quick wins (immediate value)
2. Real data (accuracy)
3. Financial (business value)
4. Advanced modeling (professional features)
5. Storage & optimization
6. Visualization & UX polish

