## Verification Plan

### Phase 1 Testing
- Export Word document with embedded charts
- Download CSV files and verify data
- Load presets and confirm values

### Phase 2 Testing
- Call PVGIS API with test coordinates
- Compare API data vs simplified model
- Verify module/inverter database lookups

### Phase 3 Testing
- Calculate financial metrics with known inputs
- Verify LCOE against industry benchmarks
- Test various financing scenarios

### Phase 4-6 Testing
- Validate hourly calculations against PVGIS hourly data
- Test shading with known horizon profiles
- Verify battery storage optimization
- Check uncertainty ranges are realistic

### Integration Testing
- Full workflow from location → results → export
- Performance with real API calls
- Mobile responsiveness
- Browser compatibility

## Technical Dependencies

**New Libraries Required**:
- `three.js` - 3D sun path visualization
- `leaflet` or `mapbox-gl` - Interactive maps
- `papaparse` - CSV parsing/generation
- `chartjs-plugin-annotation` - Enhanced charting
- `moment.js` or `date-fns` - Date/time calculations

**APIs**:
- PVGIS API (free, no key required)
- Google Maps Geocoding (requires API key - optional)
- OpenWeather Solar Radiation API (alternative data source)

